    "detailed_description": "<h1>ROADMAP</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917910/extras/9c05e4effca91b900c94d846e86110b4.avif?t=1754118839\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More at our Discord and socials!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917910/extras/52598f51aa0d3a2d2c98ee06d38422a1.poster.avif?t=1754118839\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917910/extras/52598f51aa0d3a2d2c98ee06d38422a1.webm?t=1754118839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917910/extras/52598f51aa0d3a2d2c98ee06d38422a1.mp4?t=1754118839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917910/extras/3426fa36cf5a89a96e8b368afc4cf516.avif?t=1754118839\" data-has-big width=1600 height=260 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asymmetric factions all with different playstyles \u2014 and more on the way!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surprise enemies with self-multipliers, piercer, knockbackers, cross-map movers, etc.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917910/extras/f47c04dcf629c2790fbd4e877bead77a.poster.avif?t=1754118839\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917910/extras/f47c04dcf629c2790fbd4e877bead77a.webm?t=1754118839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917910/extras/f47c04dcf629c2790fbd4e877bead77a.mp4?t=1754118839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917910/extras/d92e21c2408036954a1d3b7f144aa972.avif?t=1754118839\" data-has-big width=1600 height=260 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reinforce your dino army with found alien gears and captured buildings from other houses.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploit strange terrain, treasures and tribes across the unique   biomes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917910/extras/14a211f7c918d3d6e3ba0c9f9e43fe20.poster.avif?t=1754118839\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917910/extras/14a211f7c918d3d6e3ba0c9f9e43fe20.webm?t=1754118839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917910/extras/14a211f7c918d3d6e3ba0c9f9e43fe20.mp4?t=1754118839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917910/extras/7d58ec9e04916273a6f42c446f9ab291.avif?t=1754118839\" data-has-big width=1600 height=260 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be creative! Setup unfair starting boosts, infinite refunds,  unlimited army healing, etc.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone can break the game, but whoever is the fastest, wins!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917910/extras/edeae63d22c6b7a1afe1be628012edc5.poster.avif?t=1754118839\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917910/extras/edeae63d22c6b7a1afe1be628012edc5.webm?t=1754118839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917910/extras/edeae63d22c6b7a1afe1be628012edc5.mp4?t=1754118839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917910/extras/7ac69725d4d5172e243303368459a5dc.avif?t=1754118839\" data-has-big width=800 height=130 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different gameplay focus in all campaigns: Base Defence, Treasure Hunt,  City Building etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each highly replayable with proc-gen maps or challenging difficulty modes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917910/extras/00f9591fee24aaf3cb6706d1d4aad7e1.avif?t=1754118839\" data-has-big width=800 height=325 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917910/extras/721adfb5b1c7ba743d8e5828d2fa8d04.avif?t=1754118839\" data-has-big width=1600 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before all else, we want you to have a  great time, so please give our free Demo a try!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INCLUDES 2 SOLO CAMPAIGNS:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frontiers</strong> = TBS roguelike  experience \ud83d\ude80\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Colosseum</strong> = single battle skirmish mode \ud83e\udd95\ud83d\udca5\ud83e\udd96</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917910/extras/d01e25c95264ea014647d6c6894ac352.poster.avif?t=1754118839\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917910/extras/d01e25c95264ea014647d6c6894ac352.webm?t=1754118839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917910/extras/d01e25c95264ea014647d6c6894ac352.mp4?t=1754118839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p>",
